msgid ""
"Use a publicly reachable HTTPS domain before connecting SumUp. If you are "
"testing locally, use a tunnel such as ngrok or Cloudflare Tunnel and update "
"WordPress Home and Site URL first."
msgstr ""
"Χρησιμοποιήστε έναν δημόσια προσβάσιμο HTTPS τομέα πριν συνδέσετε το SumUp. "
